+ /*
+   RFC5106, 8.1, page 17
+
+     0 1 2 3 4 5 6 7
+    +-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+
+    |L M I 0 0 0 0 0|
+    +-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+
+
+    L = Length included
+    M = More fragments
+    I = Integrity Checksum Data included
